00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:50.900
But

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:55.730
before that, I worked for IBM
and other small companies.

00:03:55.730 --> 00:03:57.050
Always doing like,
data science,

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:00.180
some advocacy. Sometimes I was

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:04.250
as an advocate, as a role
