that I was performing.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.870
And I also founded
two communities. One, it's R-Ladies,

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:21.800
which I'm pretty sure almost
everybody here should know or

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:22.833
