00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:26.530
which I'm so grateful
for the community.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:29.150
The other one is AI Inclusive.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:31.000
And

00:04:31.550 --> 00:04:35.615
what I like to do when
I'm on my free time,

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:42.170
so I love water. So if I can
