with experts,

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:23.750
you have technical
advisors and so on.

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:26.230
So I see these two

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:31.120
ways, like one is through
events and us connecting with

00:23:31.120 --> 00:23:33.723
them, and the other one
is through our platform,

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:38.380
which they should be aware
