were in an event so it's a

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:46.944
lot of awareness.

00:23:47.830 --> 00:23:51.355
These are the two kind
of ways that we see,

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:54.670
we interact with startups.

00:23:54.670 --> 00:23:55.570
- OK.

00:23:55.570 --> 00:23:59.020
So people go from they have
an idea and then they get into

00:23:59.020 --> 00:24:03.640
