00:50:41.130 --> 00:50:44.890
that I mean, maybe is shared
quite a bit on LinkedIn or role

00:50:44.890 --> 00:50:46.270
at Microsoft.

00:50:46.270 --> 00:50:48.700
And some things that you've
learned along the way.

00:50:48.700 --> 00:50:51.490
And I thought it might be good
for all of us to share some

00:50:51.490 --> 00:50:55.690
hiring best practices here too
if we've been on that side,

00:50:55.690 --> 00:50:57.370
